EasyTier 2.7.0-astra.8 — provenance
==================================

These binaries come from our EasyTier fork, not from an upstream release:

    fork      https://github.com/alrcatraz/EasyTier
    release   https://github.com/alrcatraz/EasyTier/releases/tag/v2.7.0-astra.8-public
    built     from tag v2.7.0-astra.8 (upstream 2.7.0 plus the patches below)
    source    tag v2.7.0-astra.8-public — same tree, minus the internal CI
              configuration, which is not part of the program
    built     nix, musl static, x86_64

Patches carried in this build:

  * MagicDNS: UDP listener workaround for a self-send deadlock
  * MagicDNS: resolve without systemd-resolved, via netlink and D-Bus
    rather than shelling out to ip/resolvectl
  * TLD DNS zone and its web console page

Upstream is https://github.com/EasyTier/EasyTier — report upstream bugs there,
not to the fork.

